WEBVTT

01:37.509 --> 01:42.920
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.500 --> 01:45.890
[Episode 28]

01:46.039 --> 01:48.070
So you not only killed my mother,

01:48.070 --> 01:49.680
you almost killed me too.

02:01.180 --> 02:01.940
Qingrong.

02:04.070 --> 02:05.600
That wasn't what happened.

02:06.590 --> 02:07.590
That wasn't.

02:15.120 --> 02:16.250
It wasn't like that.

02:16.710 --> 02:17.710
It really wasn't.

02:19.400 --> 02:20.650
Listen to me.

02:20.870 --> 02:22.000
It wasn't like that.

02:27.120 --> 02:29.430
How much longer are you

02:30.710 --> 02:32.040
going to put on this act?

02:41.120 --> 02:41.750
Qingrong.

02:42.750 --> 02:43.430
Qingrong,

02:43.450 --> 02:44.910
please let me explain, okay?

02:44.910 --> 02:45.470
Enough!

02:54.280 --> 02:54.910
Qingrong.

02:57.400 --> 02:58.910
I know I was wrong.

03:00.190 --> 03:01.710
I deserve to die.

03:02.710 --> 03:04.360
Xie Shu forced me.

03:05.280 --> 03:07.800
He forced me to kill your mother.

03:11.910 --> 03:14.120
I've always wanted to atone for it.

03:15.680 --> 03:17.280
But I couldn't.

03:20.079 --> 03:22.310
It was impossible.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.360
Qingrong.

03:28.910 --> 03:30.610
But I've treated you as my own.

03:30.750 --> 03:32.000
That never changed.

03:33.630 --> 03:36.079
I fed you and raised you myself.

03:36.800 --> 03:38.310
Every time you were sick,

03:39.030 --> 03:40.960
I was right by your side.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.470
Have you forgotten?

03:43.560 --> 03:46.360
You know how I treat you, right?

03:47.910 --> 03:49.280
In this Xie Residence,

03:50.960 --> 03:53.000
Xie Shu and Old Madam

03:53.840 --> 03:55.770
only treated me as a stepping stone

03:57.079 --> 03:58.590
to climb higher.

04:00.560 --> 04:01.560
Only you...

04:03.280 --> 04:04.750
Only you and Qingru

04:06.150 --> 04:08.460
truly cared about me.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.430
Without you two,

04:10.430 --> 04:11.890
I would have died long ago.

04:16.560 --> 04:17.310
Qingrong.

04:18.240 --> 04:19.240
You can make me

04:19.240 --> 04:20.950
do anything.

04:22.120 --> 04:24.930
You can make me atone for my sins.

04:25.000 --> 04:26.360
I only beg you...

04:28.040 --> 04:29.510
don't disown me,

04:30.800 --> 04:31.480
okay?

04:33.230 --> 04:34.680
Don't disown me.

04:36.720 --> 04:38.320
You raised me all these years

04:39.870 --> 04:41.750
and called me your child.

04:42.560 --> 04:45.000
Is this your trick to atone for your sins,

04:46.040 --> 04:48.800
or do you just want to see me treat
my enemy as my mother

04:48.800 --> 04:51.390
so that you can enjoy it?

04:57.600 --> 04:58.920
No, Qingrong.

05:00.240 --> 05:02.000
I treat you as my own.

05:02.950 --> 05:04.560
My feelings for you are real.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.000
They never changed.

05:09.630 --> 05:11.240
Without you, I'd be dead.

05:11.240 --> 05:13.070
How can I be enjoying that?

05:14.430 --> 05:15.680
I beg you.

05:16.270 --> 05:18.510
Please don't disown me, okay?

05:20.120 --> 05:21.480
I'm begging you.

05:22.800 --> 05:23.560
Qingrong,

05:24.000 --> 05:25.430
I beg you.

05:26.750 --> 05:29.750
I stopped treating you
as my mother long ago.

05:38.950 --> 05:41.190
Do you know why you're sick?

05:47.390 --> 05:48.430
I know.

05:51.750 --> 05:53.210
I've known for a long time.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.240
Otherwise,

05:57.920 --> 05:59.680
how could I obediently

06:00.560 --> 06:02.630
drink the medicine you fed me?

06:08.680 --> 06:10.560
My life is yours.

06:12.630 --> 06:14.190
I'm giving it back to you.

06:20.950 --> 06:21.720
Mother!

06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
I...

06:41.920 --> 06:42.600
I...

06:45.830 --> 06:48.290
This is just a drug
to make people lethargic.

06:49.560 --> 06:50.820
Why is this happening?

06:56.000 --> 06:57.000
Qingrong...

06:58.950 --> 07:00.240
Thank you.

07:03.510 --> 07:05.830
Thank you for the medicine you fed me.

07:09.120 --> 07:11.430
It is the antidote of my life.

07:11.870 --> 07:12.630
No.

07:14.390 --> 07:15.160
No!

07:23.120 --> 07:23.950
Qingrong.

07:25.270 --> 07:26.240
Qingrong.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.360
This letter,

07:48.870 --> 07:50.680
I've hidden it for 9 years.

07:51.830 --> 07:54.159
It's time to return it to its owner.

07:57.310 --> 07:59.170
Since you already know the truth,

08:00.750 --> 08:02.560
why did you come to me?

08:03.830 --> 08:05.070
I came to you,

08:06.240 --> 08:08.760
first, to ask you to plead with Hu Xing

08:09.240 --> 08:10.840
to spare Shen Zhibai's life.

08:11.310 --> 08:12.680
He is an upright man,

08:12.920 --> 08:14.650
and shouldn't end up like this.

08:15.560 --> 08:17.240
Only you can do this.

08:18.870 --> 08:19.870
Second,

08:25.160 --> 08:26.270
I have a letter

08:27.070 --> 08:29.160
that I want you to give to Lu Lingshu.

08:30.360 --> 08:31.960
And please pass on a message:

08:33.840 --> 08:34.870
I'd like to

08:36.870 --> 08:37.909
meet her.

08:45.510 --> 08:47.120
To tell you the truth,

08:49.480 --> 08:50.600
after I see her,

08:51.600 --> 08:53.270
I plan to leave Hengtang

08:53.670 --> 08:54.720
with my daughter,

08:55.390 --> 08:56.790
leaving all this behind.

08:57.480 --> 08:59.820
Haven't you always wanted me
to go far away

08:59.900 --> 09:02.030
and never appear before Xie Shu again?

09:09.200 --> 09:10.960
I've imagined countless times

09:11.480 --> 09:14.010
how you would react
after learning the truth.

09:15.320 --> 09:17.000
But I never expected...

09:19.600 --> 09:21.330
that you would choose to leave.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.790
What I seek

09:26.360 --> 09:27.760
is different from yours.

09:28.320 --> 09:30.030
I never envied that mansion.

09:30.870 --> 09:33.730
I didn't want my daughter
to be trapped in there too,

09:34.200 --> 09:36.030
unable to see the world outside—

09:36.750 --> 09:37.960
the free life.

09:40.670 --> 09:42.320
The secrets you want

09:43.120 --> 09:44.480
are all in here.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.480
Qingrong!

10:18.510 --> 10:19.390
Why?

10:20.240 --> 10:21.600
-Why?
-Qingrong.

10:23.600 --> 10:24.390
Qingrong.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.390
Qingrong!

10:28.030 --> 10:28.870
Qingrong!

10:29.510 --> 10:31.600
Listen to me, Qingrong!

10:31.660 --> 10:33.600
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

10:36.170 --> 10:37.140
Qingrong!

10:37.390 --> 10:38.240
Qingrong!

10:39.000 --> 10:39.840
Qingrong!

10:51.360 --> 10:52.080
Qingrong!

10:53.960 --> 10:54.670
Qingrong.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.480
Qingrong.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.700
I don't ask for your forgiveness,

10:59.440 --> 11:01.040
or for you to acknowledge me.

11:01.960 --> 11:02.960
I just beg you to

11:03.870 --> 11:05.200
leave the Xie family,

11:05.840 --> 11:07.220
leave Xie Shu,

11:07.440 --> 11:08.960
leave this hellhole,

11:08.960 --> 11:11.360
and never come back to Hengtang!

11:13.200 --> 11:14.520
What are you doing?

11:15.120 --> 11:16.320
How disgraceful!

11:23.080 --> 11:24.320
Xie Shu?

11:40.390 --> 11:42.250
You're finally willing to see me?

11:44.600 --> 11:46.600
You're finally willing to see me.

11:55.600 --> 11:58.270
What's the use of seeing me now?

12:00.600 --> 12:02.670
You ruined my life.

12:03.720 --> 12:06.720
I shouldn't have hated Jin Chunqing.

12:07.600 --> 12:10.120
The one I should hate is you.

12:11.150 --> 12:12.150
Hu Wenzhuo,

12:13.440 --> 12:15.120
stop speaking nonsense,

12:15.270 --> 12:16.730
tarnishing my innocence.

12:18.600 --> 12:19.440
Innocence?

12:22.870 --> 12:24.120
Whose innocence?

12:25.360 --> 12:26.710
You're innocent?

12:31.200 --> 12:32.430
For you,

12:33.360 --> 12:34.670
for your family,

12:35.550 --> 12:37.630
I've done evil all my life.

12:39.750 --> 12:40.670
Today,

12:42.670 --> 12:45.780
I will make it up to Qingrong.

12:49.320 --> 12:51.750
I will destroy you with my own hands,

12:54.240 --> 12:56.100
and expose your most unbearable,

12:57.750 --> 13:00.030
most hidden secrets

13:00.720 --> 13:02.480
to everyone.

13:02.790 --> 13:04.270
It's time

13:05.550 --> 13:07.440
the Xie family ends.

13:09.840 --> 13:11.670
Lord Xie,

13:12.030 --> 13:13.830
the patriarch of the Xie family,

13:14.270 --> 13:15.910
Xie Shu!

13:17.840 --> 13:20.120
Don't tell me
you've forgotten it yourself

13:20.120 --> 13:22.180
that you're a fake!

13:22.390 --> 13:25.550
You're not
the biological son of the Xie family!

13:25.550 --> 13:28.270
You're an impostor!

13:28.630 --> 13:30.040
Shut up!

13:44.320 --> 13:46.160
Did you all hear that?

13:47.670 --> 13:50.320
The Xie family swapped the fake son in!

13:50.870 --> 13:52.300
This Xie Shu,

13:52.630 --> 13:55.840
is not the biological son
of the Xie family at all.

13:56.510 --> 13:59.550
He is an impostor!

14:03.360 --> 14:04.890
The one who gave birth to him

14:06.240 --> 14:08.850
was just a street gambler—

14:09.150 --> 14:12.960
one worse than a beggar who sold his son!

14:13.270 --> 14:14.660
Don't believe her!

14:15.030 --> 14:17.230
This shrew has gone mad!

14:47.270 --> 14:48.080
Mother.

14:50.360 --> 14:51.120
Mother.

15:03.320 --> 15:05.030
Not only did I drink it,

15:06.320 --> 15:07.600
but I also...

15:10.440 --> 15:12.550
added things...

15:13.320 --> 15:14.720
that worsens it.

15:19.510 --> 15:21.670
I wanted to untie the knot in your heart

15:22.750 --> 15:24.210
and repay you with my life.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.030
Qingrong...

15:32.600 --> 15:33.840
I'm sorry.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.600
I'm sorry.

15:41.780 --> 15:42.630
Mother...

16:06.840 --> 16:07.550
Mother.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.110
What are you thinking about?

16:13.150 --> 16:15.720
I had a very, very long nightmare.

16:16.840 --> 16:18.000
In the dream,

16:19.320 --> 16:20.320
I hurt you—

16:22.440 --> 16:24.320
very, very deeply.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.600
All my life,

16:27.150 --> 16:29.670
I lived in heart-piercing guilt.

16:30.750 --> 16:32.010
Until I my last breath,

16:33.480 --> 16:35.810
I was still begging for your forgiveness.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.440
In the dream,

16:45.790 --> 16:47.320
did you love me just as much?

16:58.910 --> 16:59.910
Of course.

17:01.600 --> 17:03.200
I treated you like my own.

17:10.920 --> 17:12.069
Then did you

17:14.270 --> 17:16.550
truly repent for your mistakes?

17:20.069 --> 17:21.310
Every moment,

17:23.480 --> 17:26.160
I lived in the torment of regret.

17:32.750 --> 17:33.590
Then,

17:34.920 --> 17:36.640
on behalf of my dream self,

17:37.880 --> 17:38.960
I forgive you.

17:49.070 --> 17:50.240
Qingrong,

17:51.480 --> 17:53.590
I am sorry.

17:57.510 --> 17:58.880
I love you.

18:15.480 --> 18:16.270
Mother...

18:18.070 --> 18:19.070
Mother.

18:20.880 --> 18:21.880
Mother!

18:23.110 --> 18:24.200
Mother!

18:25.720 --> 18:26.510
Mother.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.110
Mother.

18:33.000 --> 18:34.030
Mother.

18:41.350 --> 18:42.400
Mother.

18:53.720 --> 18:54.550
Your Majesty,

18:54.750 --> 18:56.210
the ginseng soup is ready.

18:56.270 --> 18:58.800
The noble families
in Hengtang are outraged.

18:59.310 --> 19:01.310
They demand severe punishment for Xie Shu

19:01.310 --> 19:02.840
to set the record straight.

19:03.030 --> 19:03.640
What?

19:03.790 --> 19:05.450
Xie Shu is of commoner origin?

19:05.850 --> 19:08.200
Madam Hu shouted it out
right before she died,

19:08.200 --> 19:09.590
right at the gate of the Xie family.

19:09.590 --> 19:10.790
Many people heard it.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.350
She was the Head Madam of the Xie family.

19:12.350 --> 19:13.750
Could her words be false?

19:14.030 --> 19:14.930
No wonder.

19:15.030 --> 19:16.270
Xie Shu never looked like someone

19:16.270 --> 19:17.870
with ancestral blessings.

19:17.960 --> 19:20.160
Turns out he is just a cuckoo in the nest.

19:21.440 --> 19:22.570
This is outrageous!

19:22.680 --> 19:24.790
A hypocrite who abandoned his real name

19:24.790 --> 19:26.200
actually relied on deception

19:26.200 --> 19:27.480
to hold a high position for years.

19:27.480 --> 19:27.880
He...

19:28.000 --> 19:29.960
He even put on an act
to lead the prominent families.

19:29.960 --> 19:31.440
This is a disgrace!

19:33.480 --> 19:35.350
Xie Shu is audacious.

19:36.000 --> 19:38.400
How dare he impersonate the son
of the Xie family for so many years.

19:38.400 --> 19:40.260
He deserves death for his crimes.

19:40.480 --> 19:42.390
How dare a fake put on airs

19:42.480 --> 19:44.160
and try to command the prominent families
of Hengtang?

19:44.160 --> 19:46.270
How could
the prominent families spare him?

19:46.270 --> 19:48.480
By letting a person of unknown origin

19:48.640 --> 19:50.110
hold important posts

19:50.510 --> 19:51.880
and command a region,

19:52.030 --> 19:53.830
it's a big disgrace to our court.

19:53.960 --> 19:55.620
How can the people be at peace?

19:56.030 --> 19:57.830
This matter must be
thoroughly investigated

19:57.830 --> 19:59.680
to give everyone an explanation.

19:59.680 --> 20:01.790
And to give us prominent families
an explanation.

20:01.790 --> 20:02.400
Everyone.

20:02.880 --> 20:04.680
We should quickly submit a joint petition

20:04.680 --> 20:05.750
to the Emperor

20:06.100 --> 20:07.960
to ask the Emperor
to look into this clearly

20:07.960 --> 20:09.720
and severely punish this imposter.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.440
Otherwise,

20:10.680 --> 20:12.010
we will never accept it.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.160
But over the years,

20:13.790 --> 20:16.320
Hengtang's tax revenues
have been abundant.

20:17.680 --> 20:18.740
Pass down my order.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.350
This matter is of great consequence.

20:20.350 --> 20:22.280
I will investigate it thoroughly.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.510
As for Xie Shu,

20:24.070 --> 20:26.270
I'll wait and see how he'll deal with it.

20:26.350 --> 20:28.010
If he can prove his innocence,

20:28.070 --> 20:29.350
or give an explanation,

20:29.350 --> 20:32.010
there might still be room
to turn things around.

20:32.880 --> 20:33.480
Yes.

20:34.230 --> 20:36.710
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

20:40.510 --> 20:42.700
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

20:42.000 --> 20:42.510
Mother.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.800
Only when disaster strikes,

20:48.000 --> 20:50.660
you realize one's true nature
is hard to change.

20:50.720 --> 20:52.880
Even if Mount Tai collapses before you,

20:52.880 --> 20:54.310
you should remain calm.

20:54.830 --> 20:57.400
Since the day you learned to read,

20:57.880 --> 21:00.200
that was the first thing I taught you.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.590
Even today,

21:04.250 --> 21:06.310
you still haven't learned this.

21:07.270 --> 21:08.110
Yes.

21:09.790 --> 21:12.110
You are absolutely right, Mother.

21:13.720 --> 21:15.160
Back then,

21:15.920 --> 21:17.550
if you hadn't

21:18.400 --> 21:20.880
swapped me in my youth

21:21.400 --> 21:25.400
into this life of luxury,

21:25.830 --> 21:28.400
I would still be forging iron
by the furnace,

21:29.310 --> 21:30.920
poor as a dog.

21:31.480 --> 21:34.200
But I am truly worthless.

21:34.290 --> 21:39.200
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

21:35.030 --> 21:39.070
I still can't rid myself
of the cheapness in my bones.

21:46.480 --> 21:48.310
Don't put on an act

21:49.350 --> 21:50.640
in front of me anymore.

21:51.270 --> 21:53.640
I know why you came to me.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.590
Hu Wenzhuo

21:57.030 --> 21:59.640
has made your identity public.

22:03.750 --> 22:05.030
You came to me

22:06.790 --> 22:08.160
for a way out.

22:11.070 --> 22:11.830
Mother.

22:12.270 --> 22:15.440
The Emperor ordered me
to give an explanation within 3 days.

22:15.440 --> 22:16.880
Those prominent families

22:16.880 --> 22:18.200
are all eyeing us like tigers,

22:18.200 --> 22:19.270
baring their fangs and claws,

22:19.270 --> 22:20.550
waiting for a chance to strike.

22:20.550 --> 22:22.200
My life or death is a small matter,

22:22.200 --> 22:23.550
but the Xie family's fate is what matters.

22:23.550 --> 22:25.550
You must save me, Mother.

22:26.110 --> 22:27.920
If this matter is found out to be true,

22:27.920 --> 22:30.310
our home will be confiscated
and our family wiped out.

22:30.310 --> 22:31.790
I am only afraid that

22:32.070 --> 22:33.750
in the future, Hengtang

22:35.440 --> 22:37.240
will no longer have a Xie family.

22:43.000 --> 22:47.990
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

22:43.440 --> 22:44.750
To solve this problem,

22:45.960 --> 22:47.750
there is only one way.

22:51.590 --> 22:52.960
I will take

22:53.680 --> 22:55.240
all the blame.

22:55.960 --> 23:00.200
I arranged everything myself

23:01.680 --> 23:03.340
and you knew nothing about it.

23:04.750 --> 23:05.350
No.

23:06.110 --> 23:07.240
This way,

23:07.640 --> 23:10.240
the government
can appease the public anger.

23:11.110 --> 23:12.240
And the Xie family

23:13.680 --> 23:16.000
will have a chance to survive.

23:18.480 --> 23:20.680
Are you really going to do this, Mother?

23:21.030 --> 23:22.030
Doesn't that mean

23:22.960 --> 23:24.760
you'll have no way out but death?

23:35.830 --> 23:39.010
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

23:41.920 --> 23:43.160
Of course

23:44.550 --> 23:45.790
I can die.

23:50.110 --> 23:53.890
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

23:57.070 --> 23:58.560
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

24:00.450 --> 24:02.920
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

24:05.270 --> 24:06.550
You must understand.

24:08.880 --> 24:12.480
It is not because
of your hypocritical pleas

24:13.880 --> 24:15.240
that I choose to die.

24:18.480 --> 24:20.400
I am doing this for the Xie family.

24:28.030 --> 24:29.830
The Xie family used to be

24:30.350 --> 24:31.680
just an ordinary

24:32.830 --> 24:34.880
noble family in Hengtang.

24:35.750 --> 24:37.920
I devoted my entire life to it

24:38.960 --> 24:40.480
to lay its foundation,

24:43.030 --> 24:44.790
which made it Hengtang's

24:46.400 --> 24:47.880
most prominent family.

24:49.550 --> 24:51.030
I will never allow

24:50.510 --> 24:53.800
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

24:51.590 --> 24:53.750
what I worked for my whole life

24:54.880 --> 24:56.440
to become a joke

24:58.030 --> 24:59.480
because of a bastard

25:03.070 --> 25:05.270
like you.

25:21.020 --> 25:24.710
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

25:57.110 --> 25:59.310
Your righteousness

26:00.030 --> 26:01.890
commands my admiration, Mother.

26:02.400 --> 26:05.480
On behalf of the Xie ancestors,

26:07.680 --> 26:09.750
I thank you, Mother.

26:28.110 --> 26:29.310
Speak.

26:31.440 --> 26:33.440
How much time do I have left?

26:39.470 --> 26:43.510
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

26:48.510 --> 26:49.440
One day.

27:12.810 --> 27:16.950
[Danyue Pavilion]

27:27.480 --> 27:28.550
You're here.

27:49.270 --> 27:50.240
Have a seat.

27:58.920 --> 28:00.400
These are the belongings

28:00.830 --> 28:02.270
left by your mother.

28:03.270 --> 28:04.240
Now,

28:06.830 --> 28:09.310
they should be returned
to their rightful owner.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.400
It was Xie Shu

28:11.510 --> 28:13.640
who forced you to take the blame for him

28:14.590 --> 28:16.720
so he could escape punishment, right?

28:23.640 --> 28:24.790
Throughout my life,

28:27.310 --> 28:29.310
I've only walked the path I chose.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.270
No one can force me.

28:35.440 --> 28:36.640
Then that day,

28:37.680 --> 28:39.940
when you abandoned your own daughter...

28:42.750 --> 28:44.410
was that also a path you chose?

28:55.070 --> 28:56.400
This is yours, isn't it,

28:56.920 --> 28:58.160
Lu Lingshu?

29:01.070 --> 29:02.270
My mom's

29:04.070 --> 29:05.350
biological mother.

29:20.790 --> 29:21.750
Yes,

29:24.070 --> 29:25.000
it's me.

29:29.750 --> 29:31.030
This was a secret

29:32.880 --> 29:35.640
I was going to take to my grave.

29:45.720 --> 29:48.620
[Lu Lingshu]

30:15.430 --> 30:16.430
At that time,

30:16.790 --> 30:19.920
to secure my position as
the Head Madam of the Xie family,

30:20.070 --> 30:22.600
and to continue the family line

30:22.790 --> 30:25.350
so we wouldn't be divided
by the collateral branches,

30:25.350 --> 30:26.640
I had no choice

30:27.160 --> 30:29.360
but to exchange my biological daughter

30:29.780 --> 30:31.730
and a baby boy

30:32.400 --> 30:33.590
from outside.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.310
Madam,

30:35.510 --> 30:37.310
this is the baby boy
the Celestial Master calculated

30:37.310 --> 30:39.910
whose birth chart
best matches the Xie family.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.110
Have a look,

30:41.550 --> 30:42.310
madam.

30:45.070 --> 30:47.400
But when I checked the genealogy that day,

30:47.400 --> 30:49.200
Lu Lingshu's name didn't appear

30:49.200 --> 30:51.030
on the Xie family's genealogy.

30:52.590 --> 30:54.790
Not long after I gave birth to Chunqing,

30:55.240 --> 30:56.480
my husband

30:57.640 --> 30:59.160
passed away.

31:00.030 --> 31:01.830
That left me alone with my child,

31:02.310 --> 31:04.550
along with a few restless concubines.

31:05.130 --> 31:06.730
With the main branch fallen,

31:07.160 --> 31:10.320
the other branches were eyeing us.

31:10.480 --> 31:14.480
They were anticipating
to tear the Xie family apart.

31:14.480 --> 31:16.000
The main branch has withered.

31:16.000 --> 31:17.310
The only boy

31:17.880 --> 31:19.610
is still in swaddling clothes.

31:19.640 --> 31:21.830
They have no successor.

31:21.830 --> 31:22.590
Exactly.

31:22.720 --> 31:24.270
The main branch has no successor.

31:24.270 --> 31:25.400
Wouldn't this huge estate

31:25.400 --> 31:26.310
go to waste?

31:26.310 --> 31:27.960
A century of the Xie family's hard work

31:27.960 --> 31:29.680
cannot just disappear like this.

31:29.680 --> 31:30.660
In my opinion,

31:30.720 --> 31:31.790
we'd better act early to

31:31.790 --> 31:32.990
inventory the assets

31:33.070 --> 31:34.750
and distribute them among the branches.

31:34.750 --> 31:36.240
-Distribute?
-That's right.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.840
-Distribute it!
-Everyone!

31:42.350 --> 31:43.880
Uncles and clansmen,

31:44.350 --> 31:46.270
the patriarch's body is not yet cold.

31:46.270 --> 31:48.070
Yet here you are, already discussing

31:48.070 --> 31:50.270
how to divide the estate he left behind?

31:52.680 --> 31:54.000
You can't put it that way.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.270
We are also worried that

31:55.270 --> 31:56.240
the main branch has no heir.

31:56.240 --> 31:58.170
Who says the main branch has no one?

31:58.310 --> 31:59.110
The patriarch

31:59.400 --> 32:00.840
left his bloodline.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.100
Niece-in-law,

32:02.510 --> 32:04.310
the patriarch's legitimate son
is still a baby.

32:04.310 --> 32:06.370
How can he manage the huge Xie family?

32:06.590 --> 32:08.140
This is no child's play!

32:08.240 --> 32:08.750
Yes.

32:09.350 --> 32:10.110
Exactly.

32:14.070 --> 32:15.240
Since Second Uncle said

32:15.240 --> 32:17.240
a young child cannot bear
the heavy responsibility,

32:17.240 --> 32:18.970
then I, Lu Lingshu, today,

32:19.070 --> 32:20.510
in front of everyone,

32:21.000 --> 32:23.070
as the birth mother of the young master,

32:23.070 --> 32:25.300
swear to the ancestors.

32:34.030 --> 32:35.310
From this day on,

32:35.590 --> 32:37.550
I will forever forget my old surname

32:37.550 --> 32:38.880
and abandon my old name.

32:39.200 --> 32:41.060
From now on, I will change my name.

32:43.750 --> 32:45.510
I will use the name Xie Chengyuan

32:45.510 --> 32:46.790
to raise the young master

32:46.790 --> 32:48.140
until he comes of age.

32:48.400 --> 32:51.110
He will then inherit the clan

32:51.480 --> 32:53.140
and bring glory to the family.

32:53.680 --> 32:55.190
Throughout my life,

32:55.550 --> 32:57.210
I will do my utmost

32:57.550 --> 33:00.040
to make the Xie family prosper—

33:00.400 --> 33:01.650
nothing else.

33:01.890 --> 33:04.270
[Chengyuan]

33:04.590 --> 33:05.850
If I violate this oath,

33:06.270 --> 33:07.830
may heaven and earth not tolerate me

33:07.830 --> 33:09.490
and the ancestors forsake me.

33:12.200 --> 33:13.830
Those collateral branches,

33:15.270 --> 33:17.730
they were all waiting
to see me become a joke.

33:18.160 --> 33:20.020
Let's see how long a woman like you

33:20.400 --> 33:21.920
can hold out.

33:22.640 --> 33:24.290
But I am naturally stubborn.

33:25.590 --> 33:27.510
I just wanted to make them shut up.

33:28.830 --> 33:30.680
But my only weapon

33:32.400 --> 33:34.940
was the son I exchanged for.

33:35.270 --> 33:36.070
Mother,

33:36.270 --> 33:38.680
I haven't let down your cultivation.

33:39.030 --> 33:40.630
In this palace examination,

33:40.680 --> 33:42.330
I ranked in the second class.

33:42.720 --> 33:47.010
Can you allow me and Shen Zhibai

33:47.310 --> 33:49.000
to stay and take office in the capital?

33:49.000 --> 33:50.790
I forced him to study hard,

33:50.790 --> 33:52.270
to seek an official position.

33:52.270 --> 33:53.780
I spent all my money

33:53.920 --> 33:55.750
to pave the way for his success.

33:55.750 --> 33:56.590
But...

33:57.200 --> 33:57.750
Mother.

33:57.750 --> 33:59.400
After he passed
the imperial examination...

33:59.400 --> 34:00.000
Today's...

34:00.000 --> 34:01.070
He had the audacity to...

34:01.070 --> 34:02.470
Bad policies and acts

34:02.920 --> 34:04.000
have taken deep root

34:04.000 --> 34:04.880
both in

34:05.110 --> 34:06.450
and out of the court.

34:06.750 --> 34:07.830
The world is exhausted,

34:07.830 --> 34:09.830
and everything needs to be rebuilt.

34:10.320 --> 34:11.510
Brother Shen Zhibai and I

34:11.510 --> 34:12.630
made a great vow

34:13.150 --> 34:15.860
to emulate the wise ministers
of ancient times:

34:16.110 --> 34:17.400
abolish the noble families

34:17.400 --> 34:19.230
and clear away the powerful clans.

34:19.230 --> 34:20.760
For the people of the world,

34:20.800 --> 34:22.320
we dedicate our loyal hearts,

34:22.320 --> 34:23.920
even at the cost of our lives.

34:23.920 --> 34:27.440
so as to live up to your cultivation

34:27.630 --> 34:29.480
and this official title.

34:37.030 --> 34:38.710
Abolish the noble families

34:39.480 --> 34:41.409
and clear away the powerful clans?

34:41.510 --> 34:42.110
Yes.

34:48.230 --> 34:49.320
Xie Shu,

34:50.400 --> 34:51.960
think carefully.

34:52.670 --> 34:54.670
Is your second class official title

34:55.360 --> 34:58.230
really achieved through

34:58.840 --> 35:00.550
your hard study,

35:01.030 --> 35:03.000
or was it paved by

35:03.880 --> 35:06.590
Xie family,

35:06.710 --> 35:08.070
a powerful clan's

35:08.440 --> 35:09.760
splurging?

35:11.230 --> 35:11.760
This...

35:11.760 --> 35:13.030
You don't think

35:13.920 --> 35:15.520
that leaving the Xie family,

35:15.840 --> 35:18.070
with your little talent,

35:18.320 --> 35:21.760
you could cross
the chasm of the noble families

35:22.000 --> 35:24.260
and reach the imperial palace directly?

35:26.360 --> 35:27.030
Mother.

35:27.230 --> 35:28.960
Don't mention this again!

35:32.030 --> 35:33.070
Kneel down!

35:40.630 --> 35:41.960
Listen to me.

35:43.070 --> 35:46.110
I have agreed with the Hu family.

35:46.800 --> 35:48.840
Choose an auspicious day,

35:50.440 --> 35:51.920
and you will marry

35:52.510 --> 35:54.110
Hu Xing's sister,

35:55.320 --> 35:57.710
Hu Wenzhuo, as your wife.

36:01.800 --> 36:02.550
Mother!

36:02.840 --> 36:03.800
The Hu family

36:04.480 --> 36:07.110
is the head
of the noble families in Hengtang.

36:08.480 --> 36:10.510
Their eldest son, Hu Xing,

36:11.320 --> 36:12.280
will

36:12.710 --> 36:14.760
certainly achieve

36:15.630 --> 36:17.230
great success in the court.

36:18.510 --> 36:19.360
He

36:21.070 --> 36:25.150
is your foundation
to stand firm in the court.

36:26.030 --> 36:27.320
He enjoyed

36:27.320 --> 36:30.880
the life of luxury that my daughter
should have enjoyed,

36:31.030 --> 36:34.190
so this is the price he must pay.

36:42.320 --> 36:43.440
The Xie family's

36:43.800 --> 36:46.270
wealth and dignity today,

36:46.710 --> 36:48.380
is all built up by me,

36:48.800 --> 36:50.750
Xie Chengyuan,

36:51.000 --> 36:52.440
a desperate

36:53.510 --> 36:54.960
woman

36:55.480 --> 36:56.630
step by step.

36:57.230 --> 36:58.590
For decades,

36:59.030 --> 37:00.570
I have racked my brains

37:01.000 --> 37:02.590
to achieve how magnificent

37:04.150 --> 37:05.710
the Xie family is now.

37:07.800 --> 37:09.550
Looking at the entire Hengtang

37:10.320 --> 37:11.520
and even the capital,

37:12.030 --> 37:14.000
which woman in the inner courtyard

37:15.630 --> 37:17.760
could achieve what I have?

37:18.880 --> 37:19.800
That's right.

37:20.710 --> 37:21.860
Jin Chunqing

37:23.280 --> 37:25.270
is my own child.

37:27.960 --> 37:29.000
So what?

37:31.670 --> 37:33.110
For the Xie family,

37:34.320 --> 37:35.720
if I had to sacrifice her,

37:36.590 --> 37:37.850
then I sacrificed her.

37:45.800 --> 37:47.360
What you want to know,

37:47.840 --> 37:49.370
I have told you everything.

37:49.880 --> 37:51.880
I used to be Lu Lingshu,

37:54.110 --> 37:55.440
and I also used to be

37:56.710 --> 37:58.510
your mother's mother.

38:00.320 --> 38:01.820
But Lu Lingshu

38:02.710 --> 38:04.110
is long gone.

38:04.670 --> 38:06.230
And I, Xie Chengyuan,

38:07.510 --> 38:09.170
have absolutely nothing to do

38:11.110 --> 38:13.510
with you, Chen Qingyuan.

38:14.400 --> 38:15.800
I won't implicate you.

38:20.840 --> 38:22.150
I just wanted...

38:25.190 --> 38:26.280
to see you again.

38:31.190 --> 38:32.840
I've said all I needed to say.

38:34.510 --> 38:35.510
You may leave.

38:37.920 --> 38:38.670
Is that so?

38:41.800 --> 38:43.710
If you are truly

38:44.630 --> 38:46.830
as heartless and resolute as you claim,

38:49.550 --> 38:51.410
why did you tuck the copper mirror

38:53.110 --> 38:55.170
into my mother's swaddling clothes?

38:55.280 --> 38:56.030
Your name

38:56.760 --> 38:57.880
is hidden in it.

38:58.670 --> 39:00.070
Weren't you just hoping

39:01.440 --> 39:02.480
that one day

39:04.190 --> 39:05.550
you could meet again?

39:06.920 --> 39:08.780
Also, I remember when I was young,

39:10.070 --> 39:11.190
there was a lord

39:12.550 --> 39:14.840
who always secretly helped us.

39:15.590 --> 39:17.320
If you really forgot about her,

39:18.030 --> 39:19.430
then how can this longing

39:19.920 --> 39:21.030
be explained?

39:24.840 --> 39:25.960
Old Madam Xie?

39:28.110 --> 39:29.150
Lu Lingshu?

39:34.760 --> 39:36.630
Or should I call you...

39:39.670 --> 39:40.630
Grandmother?

39:47.840 --> 39:51.230
Actually, I've been
silently watching Chunqing.

39:52.070 --> 39:53.920
Watching her grow up,

39:54.320 --> 39:57.360
watching her graceful figure on the stage,

39:58.150 --> 40:00.640
I was happier than anyone else.

40:02.510 --> 40:03.480
Back then,

40:05.510 --> 40:06.640
was Mom's encounter

40:07.510 --> 40:08.840
with Xie Shu

40:10.880 --> 40:12.140
really a coincidence?

40:14.670 --> 40:15.360
No.

40:18.480 --> 40:20.000
It was destiny.

40:24.880 --> 40:27.110
Xie Shu's friend, Shen Zhibai,

40:27.400 --> 40:28.930
loved listening to operas.

40:29.000 --> 40:30.000
That day,

40:30.230 --> 40:32.670
he dragged Xie Shu to watch a play.

40:32.920 --> 40:34.750
Little did they know, this trip

40:35.000 --> 40:36.760
would forge an ill-fated relationship

40:36.760 --> 40:38.230
between Chunqing

40:38.440 --> 40:39.980
and Xie Shu.

40:40.910 --> 40:43.050
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

40:43.070 --> 40:45.140
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

40:49.590 --> 40:51.190
Sure enough, not long after,

40:51.590 --> 40:52.760
the two of them

40:52.840 --> 40:54.000
fell in love.

40:55.590 --> 40:57.710
After discovering they were in love,

40:58.360 --> 41:01.560
I went from being terrified to hesitant.

41:02.110 --> 41:05.920
Gradually, I even looked forward to it.

41:08.480 --> 41:09.190
Chunqing.

41:10.150 --> 41:10.920
Look.

41:11.590 --> 41:13.910
That's the inner household library.

41:14.280 --> 41:19.480
Later, Xie Shu told me
he wanted to marry Chunqing.

41:20.190 --> 41:21.760
I was thrilled.

41:22.360 --> 41:25.710
I thanked God for using this way

41:25.800 --> 41:29.760
to bring Chunqing back to me.

41:37.840 --> 41:39.070
Greetings, Mother.

41:43.400 --> 41:44.280
Chunqing,

41:45.400 --> 41:46.400
you're back.

41:48.030 --> 41:49.320
Welcome back.

41:50.360 --> 41:51.150
From now on,

41:52.880 --> 41:54.600
this is your home.

41:59.280 --> 42:00.590
Thank you, Mother.

42:02.430 --> 42:04.950
[Danyue Pavilion]

42:03.550 --> 42:05.630
I wanted to doubly compensate her.

42:05.030 --> 42:07.820
[Fuyu Pavilion]

42:06.590 --> 42:10.710
So I gave
the best Danyue Pavilion to Chunqing.

42:11.710 --> 42:13.510
I wanted to keep her safe.

42:16.000 --> 42:17.190
But, what a pity.

42:17.840 --> 42:19.280
Soon, Xie Shu

42:19.550 --> 42:21.550
was favored by Eunuch Xia

42:20.660 --> 42:22.730
[Jingmu Hall]

42:21.550 --> 42:23.750
and was promoted to work in the capital.

42:24.030 --> 42:26.880
And Xia Yingying,
forced upon us by Eunuch Xia,

42:27.550 --> 42:28.850
pushed all of this

42:29.280 --> 42:30.840
to ruin.

42:32.500 --> 42:34.710
[Jingmu Hall]

42:37.630 --> 42:39.030
-If you have any complaints...
-Chunqing.

42:39.030 --> 42:39.920
You can...

42:40.030 --> 42:40.680
Shut up!

42:44.710 --> 42:46.510
The concubines in the residence

42:46.510 --> 42:47.830
hated Xia Yingying

42:48.030 --> 42:49.670
deeply.

42:49.760 --> 42:51.160
But towards Chunqing,

42:51.280 --> 42:52.670
they were jealous.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.830
After Xia Yingying died,

42:55.190 --> 42:58.440
Hu Wenzhuo's brother,
working under Eunuch Xia,

42:58.670 --> 43:01.880
began investigating the matter.

43:02.320 --> 43:05.400
The outcome would definitely
be unfavorable to Chunqing.

43:05.400 --> 43:06.360
So,

43:06.360 --> 43:09.070
I made a deal with the Hu family

43:09.550 --> 43:12.590
to let Chunqing leave the Xie Residence.
